1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:01,885
You don't really know Jason Duval.

2
00:00:01,922 --> 00:00:02,860
Not yet.

3
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:05,718
One. Rockstar says Jason grew up around

4
00:00:05,718 --> 00:00:07,155
grifters and crooks.

5
00:00:07,167 --> 00:00:08,905
Hustlers weren't strangers.

6
00:00:08,905 --> 00:00:10,530
They were the people around him.

7
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:12,975
Two. To shake off his troubled teens,

8
00:00:12,975 --> 00:00:14,225
he joined the Army.

9
00:00:14,288 --> 00:00:15,525
Look at the key art.

10
00:00:15,525 --> 00:00:17,075
The shirt still says it.

11
00:00:17,395 --> 00:00:18,820
Three. After the Army,

12
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:19,995
he went back to what he knows

13
00:00:19,995 --> 00:00:21,570
best. In the Keys,

14
00:00:21,570 --> 00:00:23,520
working for local drug runners.

15
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,520
His boss Brian even lets him live

16
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:27,383
rent free... if he helps with the

17
00:00:27,383 --> 00:00:28,445
shakedowns.

18
00:00:28,765 --> 00:00:30,815
Four. All Jason wants is an easy

19
00:00:30,815 --> 00:00:33,365
life. But in Rockstar's own words,

20
00:00:33,365 --> 00:00:35,190
things just keep getting harder.

21
00:00:35,510 --> 00:00:37,485
And five. Meeting Lucia could be the

22
00:00:37,485 --> 00:00:39,235
best, or the worst thing that ever

23
00:00:39,235 --> 00:00:40,335
happened to him.

24
00:00:40,373 --> 00:00:42,360
Even Jason can't tell yet.

25
00:00:42,730 --> 00:00:44,180
So... how much did you know?

26
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:45,605
Tell me in the comments.

